\section{Secondary Results and Evidence Status}
\label{sec:b-secondary}
\paragraph{Adverse regimes.}
Worst scheduling regret is 1.217 at batch 256; Vogue E1 ratios span 0.895--1.175 (\cref{sec:7-6}). T5 CAGRA fp32 wins every batch-8 dataset at recall 0.97; batch-32 ties depend on the estimator (\cref{sec:7-smallbatch}).

