\section{Artifact Access}
\label{sec:b-artifacts}
The \href{https://github.com/lrlorry/8800_report/blob/main/docs/artifact-access.md}{project artifact archive} provides source/measurement snapshots and selected T4/T5, T1 and A2 inputs. Complete vectors, model states and historical executables are absent; GPU reproduction needs those plus the matching environment.

